lar coordinates into the function $f(x,y,z)=\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})^{3}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y,z) & =f(\\rho \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\\rho \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\\rho \\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{({\\rho }^{2})}^{3}} \\\\  & ={\\rho }^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})^{3}}\\,\\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}{\\rho }^{3}\\cdot {\\rho }^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\,d\\rho \\,d\\theta \\,dϕ \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\rho }^{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\,d\\rho \\,d\\theta \\,dϕ.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482590 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129281 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d85b11c-498d-53b7-98f8-b742b46e8dc2" :knowledge-point/title "Rewriting a Triple Integral Defined Over a Part-Sphere"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "35fc13f0-b773-5726-937d-054c6171b474" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}{\\rho }^{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\,d\\rho \\,d\\theta \\,dϕ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186481907} {:answer/id #uuid "69680282-f956-58f9-9786-03a064080a79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}{\\rho }^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\,d\\rho \\,d\\theta \\,dϕ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482017} {:answer/id #uuid "7d57d3ba-c82f-5a22-baeb-bcab9c948a51" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}}{\\rho }^{6}{sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\\,d\\rho \\,d\\theta \\,dϕ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482061} {:answer/id #uuid "8506